<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Fedor Bogomolov 80th Birthday Conference</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f7f4ef;
      --paper: #ffffff;
      --ink: #18212f;
      --muted: #5f6877;
      --accent: #7a1f1f;
      --accent-soft: #f1dfdc;
      --line: #ded8cf;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--bg);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    a:hover,
    a:focus {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    header {
      padding: 64px 24px 48px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 0%, #f4e9e5 100%);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 980px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 840px;
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.8rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .subtitle {
      margin: 28px 0 0;
      max-width: 720px;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    nav {
      margin-top: 36px;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    }

    nav a {
      padding: 9px 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    main {
      padding: 48px 24px 72px;
    }

    section {
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .panel {
      background: var(--paper);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(24, 33, 47, 0.05);
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      font-size: 2rem;
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .info-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 24px;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    }

    .info-card {
      padding: 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #fbfaf8;
    }

    .label {
      margin: 0 0 4px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .value {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .speaker-list {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 24px 0 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .speaker-list li {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #fbfaf8;
      transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
    }

    .speaker-list li:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(24, 33, 47, 0.08);
    }

    .speaker-list a {
      display: block;
      padding: 18px;
      font-size: 1.12rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .note {
      margin-top: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 28px 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      header {
        padding-top: 44px;
      }

      .info-grid,
      .speaker-list {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .panel {
        padding: 22px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">New York University · 2-3 October 2026</p>
      <h1>Conference in honour of Fedor Bogomolov's 80th birthday</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        A two-day conference celebrating Fedor Bogomolov and his influence on algebraic geometry and related areas.
      </p>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#speakers">Speakers</a>
        <a href="#organisers">Organisers</a>
        <a href="#practical">Practical information</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="container">
      <section id="about" class="panel">
        <h2>About the conference</h2>
        <p>
          This conference will be held at New York University on 2-3 October 2026, in honour of Fedor Bogomolov's 80th birthday.
        </p>
        <p>
          The programme will bring together speakers whose work reflects the breadth of Bogomolov's mathematical influence.
        </p>
        <div class="info-grid" aria-label="Conference details">
          <div class="info-card">
            <p class="label">Dates</p>
            <p class="value">2-3 October 2026</p>
          </div>
          <div class="info-card">
            <p class="label">Venue</p>
            <p class="value">New York University</p>
          </div>
          <div class="info-card">
            <p class="label">City</p>
            <p class="value">New York, USA</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="speakers" class="panel">
        <h2>Speakers</h2>
        <p>The invited speakers are listed alphabetically by surname.</p>
        <ul class="speaker-list">
          <li><a href="https://www.imo.universite-paris-saclay.fr/~ekaterina.amerik/">Ekaterina Amerik</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.math.miami.edu/~bdeolive/">Bruno de Oliveira</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.ihes.fr/~gromov/">Mikhail Gromov</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.math.brown.edu/~bhassett/">Brendan Hassett</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.math.stonybrook.edu/~kamenova/">Ljudmila Kamenova</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://people.miami.edu/profile/285d74bf51ccc978f527c1386e82d0d4">Ludmil Katzarkov</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.mat.uniroma2.it/~mcquilla/">Michael McQuillan</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://math.jhu.edu/~shokurov/">Vyacheslav Shokurov</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="organisers" class="panel">
        <h2>Organisers</h2>
        <p>
          Paolo Cascini, Ivan Cheltsov and James McKernan.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="practical" class="panel">
        <h2>Practical information</h2>
        <p>
          Further details about the schedule, lecture room, registration and local information will be posted here closer to the conference.
        </p>
        <p class="note">
          This page is a preliminary announcement. Please check back for updates.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      Conference in honour of Fedor Bogomolov's 80th birthday · NYU · 2-3 October 2026
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
